@0    = ~You and your adventuring stories. You needn't talk yourself up, Faren. I've seen you in battle - you're as quick as the next man. If the next man isn't me, heh.~
@1    = ~Ha, am I that obvious? I'm going to have to get a bit more subtle.~
@2    = ~No shame in fear. I learned that the hard way, many years ago.~
@3    = ~Being ashamed of getting scared's about the dumbest thing I heard.~
@4    = ~Since Jan suggested making that explosive turnip-poultice, anyway.~
@5    = ~We-ell, it's true that the leg wouldn't bother you after he was done with it...~
@6    = ~Maybe I just like talking about what's happened to me. You know?~
@7    = ~Then good on you. I won't stop you.~
@8    = ~Excellent! Let me tell you about the evil ceiling...~
